    "created_at": "2022-12-01T00:53:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-01T00:53:20Z",
    "body": "I think Promises are special because they're the platform's mechanism for communicating across threads, but they're not actually thread-safe, and that misleads authors.",
